Amazon Sales Dashboard using Tableau

Project Overview

This project demonstrates an interactive Tableau dashboard built using the Amazon Sales dataset. The dashboard is designed to analyze sales performance, profitability, regional trends, and customer behavior through interactive visualizations.

Objective

To provide business users with an interactive dashboard for monitoring KPIs, identifying trends, and supporting data-driven decision-making.

Dataset

Amazon Sales Dataset

Tools Used

• Tableau Public
• Data Visualization
• Calculated Fields
• Filters
• Dashboard Actions

Dashboard Components

• KPI Cards
• Monthly Sales Trend
• Sales by Region
• Sales by Category
• Profit by Category
• Top 10 Sub-Categories
• Payment Method Distribution
• Customer Segment Analysis

Business Value

The dashboard enables users to monitor business performance, compare regional sales, identify profitable categories, and analyze customer purchasing patterns through interactive visualizations.
